{"id":87,"name":"الأعلى","transliteration":"Al-A'la","translation_fr":"Le Très-Haut","translation_en":"The Most High","type":"meccan","total_verses":19,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"سَبِّحِ ٱسۡمَ رَبِّكَ ٱلۡأَعۡلَى","translation_fr":"Glorifie le nom de ton Seigneur, le Très Haut","translation_en":"Exalt the name of your Lord, the Most High","transliteration":"Sabbihi isma rabbika alaAAla"},{"id":2,"text":"ٱلَّذِي خَلَقَ فَسَوَّىٰ","translation_fr":"Celui Qui a créé et agencé harmonieusement","translation_en":"Who created and proportioned","transliteration":"Allathee khalaqa fasawwa"},{"id":3,"text":"وَٱلَّذِي قَدَّرَ فَهَدَىٰ","translation_fr":"qui a décrété et guidé","translation_en":"And who destined and [then] guided","transliteration":"Waallathee qaddara fahada"},{"id":4,"text":"وَٱلَّذِيٓ أَخۡرَجَ ٱلۡمَرۡعَىٰ","translation_fr":"et qui a fait pousser le pâturage","translation_en":"And who brings out the pasture","transliteration":"Waallathee akhraja almarAAa"},{"id":5,"text":"فَجَعَلَهُۥ غُثَآءً أَحۡوَىٰ","translation_fr":"et en a fait ensuite un foin sombre","translation_en":"And [then] makes it black stubble","transliteration":"FajaAAalahu ghuthaan ahwa"},{"id":6,"text":"سَنُقۡرِئُكَ فَلَا تَنسَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"Nous te ferons réciter (le Coran), de sorte que tu n'oublieras","translation_en":"We will make you recite, [O Muhammad], and you will not forget","transliteration":"Sanuqrioka fala tansa"},{"id":7,"text":"إِلَّا مَا شَآءَ ٱللَّهُۚ إِنَّهُۥ يَعۡلَمُ ٱلۡجَهۡرَ وَمَا يَخۡفَىٰ","translation_fr":"que ce qu'Allah veut. Car, Il connaît ce qui paraît au grand jour ainsi que ce qui est caché","translation_en":"Except what Allah should will. Indeed, He knows what is declared and what is hidden","transliteration":"Illa ma shaa Allahu innahu yaAAlamu aljahra wama yakhfa"},{"id":8,"text":"وَنُيَسِّرُكَ لِلۡيُسۡرَىٰ","translation_fr":"Nous te mettrons sur la voie la plus facile","translation_en":"And We will ease you toward ease","transliteration":"Wanuyassiruka lilyusra"},{"id":9,"text":"فَذَكِّرۡ إِن نَّفَعَتِ ٱلذِّكۡرَىٰ","translation_fr":"Rappelle, donc, où le Rappel doit être utile","translation_en":"So remind, if the reminder should benefit","transliteration":"Fathakkir in nafaAAati alththikra"},{"id":10,"text":"سَيَذَّكَّرُ مَن يَخۡشَىٰ","translation_fr":"Quiconque craint (Allah) s'[en] rappellera","translation_en":"He who fears [Allah] will be reminded","transliteration":"Sayaththakkaru man yakhsha"},{"id":11,"text":"وَيَتَجَنَّبُهَا ٱلۡأَشۡقَى","translation_fr":"et s'en écartera le grand malheureux","translation_en":"But the wretched one will avoid it","transliteration":"Wayatajannabuha alashqa"},{"id":12,"text":"ٱلَّذِي يَصۡلَى ٱلنَّارَ ٱلۡكُبۡرَىٰ","translation_fr":"qui brûlera dans le plus grand Feu","translation_en":"[He] who will [enter and] burn in the greatest Fire","transliteration":"Allathee yasla alnnara alkubra"},{"id":13,"text":"ثُمَّ لَا يَمُوتُ فِيهَا وَلَا يَحۡيَىٰ","translation_fr":"où il ne mourra ni ne vivra","translation_en":"Neither dying therein nor living","transliteration":"Thumma la yamootu feeha wala yahya"},{"id":14,"text":"قَدۡ أَفۡلَحَ مَن تَزَكَّىٰ","translation_fr":"Réussit, certes, celui qui se purifie","translation_en":"He has certainly succeeded who purifies himself","transliteration":"Qad aflaha man tazakka"},{"id":15,"text":"وَذَكَرَ ٱسۡمَ رَبِّهِۦ فَصَلَّىٰ","translation_fr":"et se rappelle le nom de son Seigneur, puis célèbre la Salât","translation_en":"And mentions the name of his Lord and prays","transliteration":"Wathakara isma rabbihi fasalla"},{"id":16,"text":"بَلۡ تُؤۡثِرُونَ ٱلۡحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنۡيَا","translation_fr":"Mais, vous préférez plutôt la vie présente","translation_en":"But you prefer the worldly life","transliteration":"Bal tuthiroona alhayata alddunya"},{"id":17,"text":"وَٱلۡأٓخِرَةُ خَيۡرٞ وَأَبۡقَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"alors que l'au-delà est meilleur et plus durable","translation_en":"While the Hereafter is better and more enduring","transliteration":"Waalakhiratu khayrun waabqa"},{"id":18,"text":"إِنَّ هَٰذَا لَفِي ٱلصُّحُفِ ٱلۡأُولَىٰ","translation_fr":"Ceci se trouve, certes, dans les Feuilles anciennes","translation_en":"Indeed, this is in the former scriptures","transliteration":"Inna hatha lafee alssuhufi aloola"},{"id":19,"text":"صُحُفِ إِبۡرَٰهِيمَ وَمُوسَىٰ","translation_fr":"les Feuilles d'Abraham et de Moïse","translation_en":"The scriptures of Abraham and Moses","transliteration":"Suhufi ibraheema wamoosa"}]}